{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-bar-involution-parity-decomposition","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proof","doco:Section"],"label":"prf:bar-involution-parity-decomposition","kind":"proof","title":"Proof of the even/odd decomposition","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-bar-involution-parity-decomposition","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-bar-involution"],"text":"bar-involution-parity-decomposition-proof.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prf:bar-involution-parity-decomposition\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code> be linear with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma^2 = \\mathrm{id}</code>. For any <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x</code>,</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">\\mathrm{even}(x) + \\mathrm{odd}(x) = (x + \\sigma x) + (x - \\sigma x) = 2x</code></pre>\n<p>. When <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code> is invertible in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x</code> is half the sum of its two parts; the identity itself needs no division. The even part is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code>-fixed: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma(x + \\sigma x) = \\sigma x + \\sigma^2 x = x + \\sigma x</code>. The odd part is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code>-anti: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma(x - \\sigma x) = \\sigma x - x = -(x - \\sigma x)</code>. <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\qquad\\blacksquare</code></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/bar-involution-parity-decomposition-proof.md","heading":"Proof","page":"b/prf-bar-involution-parity-decomposition","qa":{"counts":{"pass":1,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":0,"unknown":0,"stale":0}}}
